t is.", "metadata": {"speaker_abbreviation": "J", "speaker": "Jay Novella"}}]}]}, {"id": 17, "text": "", "title": "Questions/Emails/Corrections/Follow-ups", "metadata": {"title": "Questions/Emails/Corrections/Follow-ups"}, "sections": [{"id": 18, "text": "", "title": "Follow-up #1: Sea Hawk vs. Seahawks", "metadata": {"timestamp": "1:08:15", "hour": "1", "minute": "08", "second": "15", "title": "Follow-up #1: Sea Hawk vs. Seahawks"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 19, "text": "", "title": "Follow-up #2: Feedback on the \"show from the future\"", "metadata": {"timestamp": "1:10:08", "hour": "1", "minute": "10", "second": "08", "title": "Follow-up #2: Feedback on the \"show from the future\""}, "sections": []}]}, {"id": 20, "text": "Voiceover: It's time for Science or Fiction.\n", "title": "Science or Fiction", "metadata": {"timestamp": "1:16:23", "hour": "1", "minute": "16", "second": "23", "title": "Science or Fiction"}, "sections": [{"id": 21, "text": "", "title": "Evan's Response", "metadata": {"title": "Evan's Response"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 22, "text": "", "title": "Jay's Response", "metadata": {"title": "Jay's Response"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 23, "text": "", "title": "Bob's Response", "metadata": {"title": "Bob's Response"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 24, "text": "", "title": "Cara's Response", "metadata": {"title": "Cara's Response"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 25, "text": "", "title": "Steve Explains Item #3", "metadata": {"title": "Steve Explains Item #3"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 26, "text": "", "title": "Steve Explains Item #2", "metadata": {"title": "Steve Explains Item #2"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 27, "text": "", "title": "Steve Explains Item #1", "metadata": {"title": "Steve Explains Item #1"}, "sections": []}]}, {"id": 28, "text": "", "title": "Skeptical Quote of the Week", "metadata": {"timestamp": "1:31:17", "hour": "1", "minute": "31", "second": "17", "title": "Skeptical Quote of the Week"}, "sections": [{"id": 29, "text": "I think if you're spending more time denying evidence than looking for it, then you've probably left the path of intelligent skepticism. \u2013 Alan Love, Ph.D., American science journalist and virologist on This Week in Virology", "metadata": {"speaker": "<unknown>"}}]}, {"id": 30, "text": "", "title": "Signoff/Announcements", "metadata": {"title": "Signoff/Announcements"}, "sections": [{"id": 31, "text": "\u2014and until next week, this is your  Skeptics' Guide to the Universe.", "metadata": {"speaker_abbreviation": "S", "speaker": "Steven Novella"}}, {"id": 32, "text": "Skeptics' Guide to the Universe is produced by SGU Productions, dedicated to promoting science and critical thinking. For more information, visit us at theskepticsguide.org. Send your questions to info@theskepticsguide.org. And, if you would like to support the show and all the work that we do, go to patreon.com/SkepticsGuide and consider becoming a patron and becoming part of the SGU community. Our listeners and supporters are what make SGU possible.", "metadata": {"links": ["http://www.theskepticsguide.org", "https://www.patreon.com/SkepticsGuide"], "speaker_abbreviation": "S", "speaker": "Steven Novella"}}]}, {"id": 33, "text": "", "title": "Today I Learned", "metadata": {"title": "Today I Learned"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 34, "text": "\n\u2191 Scientific American: No One Can Explain Why Planes Stay in the Air\n\n\u2191 Neurologica: Binaural Beats, Mood and Memory\n\n\u2191 Live Science: Scientists discover first known animal that doesn't breathe\n\n\u2191 LA Times: Death of rocket man 'Mad Mike' Hughes ends years of close calls\n\n\u2191 Duke Today: Solar Storms Could Scramble Whales' Navigational Sense\n\n\u2191 ScienceDaily: Earthquakes disrupt sperm whales' ability to find food\n\n\u2191 BBC News: 'Astonishing' blue whale numbers at South Georgia\n\n\u2191 [url_for_TIL publication: title]\n\n", "title": "References", "metadata": {"links": ["https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/no-one-can-explain-why-planes-stay-i